WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.310
Campus life can be busy and sometimes stressful.
校园生活可能很忙碌，有时还压力很大。

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:13.210
Many students rush between classes, wait in long lines and struggle to find the information they need.
许多学生在一节节课之间匆忙奔走，排着长队，还要费很大劲才能找到所需的信息。

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:18.820
To make their daily lives easier, I would like to propose three practical measures.
为了让他们的日常生活更便利，我想提出三条切实可行的措施。

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:34.210
To begin with, the university could develop a single mobile app that brings together course schedules, library seat reservations, repair requests and canteen menus, so that students no longer have to visit several websites or offices.
首先，学校可以开发一个统一的手机应用，把课程表、图书馆座位预约、报修申请和食堂菜单整合在一起，这样学生就不必再去好几个网站或办公室了。

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:44.020
In addition, the opening hours of key facilities such as the library and the gym could be extended into the evening, when most students are free.
此外，图书馆和体育馆等重要设施的开放时间可以延长到晚上，那时大多数学生都有空。

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:51.780
Finally, a one-stop service center would allow students to handle paperwork, ask questions and get help in one place.
最后，设立一个一站式服务中心，就能让学生在一个地方办理手续、咨询问题和获得帮助。

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:58.820
These measures would not require a large investment, yet they would save students a great deal of time and energy.
这些措施不需要大量投入，却能为学生节省大量的时间和精力。

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:05.820
With fewer daily hassles, students could focus more on their studies and enjoy a richer campus life.
日常的烦心事少了，学生就能更加专注于学业，享受更加丰富的校园生活。

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:11.290
I sincerely hope the university will give this proposal serious consideration.
我真诚地希望学校能认真考虑这一建议。
